# Waking the Colossus' Progress and Event replies against the rival containers at the same NPCs (task 5 review
# Important 1): a Progress reply ties a Progress rival and beats an Event one; an Event reply loses to the first and
# ties the second. main, carl and dan talk once; bob, eve and fay talk twice; finish option 1 leaves every state as it
# was (eve's plain finish sets Prog 2). main (Naja Salaheem, 929 at Prog 5 with the Whisper): Promotion: Private First
# Class accepted answers 5001 (an Event): 929 over it. bob / carl / dan (Imperial Whitegate, bob twice: 926 available
# at Prog 1 without the missive; 927 the Jeuno letter at Prog 2; 928 the Whisper at Prog 4): Trust: Nashmeira's 5092
# (a Progress): the tie (bob twice: the first container's, then the other rotated). eve (Ru'Lude Gardens _6r9: 10115
# at Prog 1): talk, finish (Prog 2), a GM sets Prog 1, talk again: 10115 again. fay (Metalworks Iron_Eater, 968 at
# Prog 2 with the Imperial Missive): Bastok 3-1 current answers 715 (a Progress): the tie, twice (the first
# container's, then the other rotated).
lists AhtUrhganWhitegate/Naja_Salaheem/onTrigger AhtUrhganWhitegate/Imperial_Whitegate/onTrigger RuludeGardens/_6r9/onTrigger Metalworks/Iron_Eater/onTrigger
char zone=AhtUrhganWhitegate pos=24.2,-7.804,-45.591 job=WAR lvl=75 nation=1
char bob zone=AhtUrhganWhitegate pos=155.796,-4.199,0.03 job=WAR lvl=75 nation=1
char carl zone=AhtUrhganWhitegate pos=155.796,-4.199,0.03 job=WAR lvl=75 nation=1
char dan zone=AhtUrhganWhitegate pos=155.796,-4.199,0.03 job=WAR lvl=75 nation=1
char eve zone=RuludeGardens pos=0,-5,66 job=WAR lvl=75 nation=1
char fay zone=Metalworks pos=91,-19,1 job=WAR lvl=75 nation=1
setting ENABLE_TRUST_QUESTS 1
quest AhtUrhgan.WakingTheColossus accepted
charvar Quest[6][74]Prog 5
keyitem WhisperOfRadiance
quest AhtUrhgan.PromotionPrivateFirstClass accepted
bob: charvar Quest[6][74]Prog 1
bob: keyitem SanDoriaTrustPermit
bob: mission Toau TheEmpressCrowned completed
carl: quest AhtUrhgan.WakingTheColossus accepted
carl: charvar Quest[6][74]Prog 2
carl: keyitem JeunoanApprovalLetter
carl: keyitem SanDoriaTrustPermit
carl: mission Toau TheEmpressCrowned completed
dan: quest AhtUrhgan.WakingTheColossus accepted
dan: charvar Quest[6][74]Prog 4
dan: keyitem WhisperOfRadiance
dan: keyitem SanDoriaTrustPermit
dan: mission Toau TheEmpressCrowned completed
eve: quest AhtUrhgan.WakingTheColossus accepted
eve: charvar Quest[6][74]Prog 1
eve: keyitem ImperialMissive
fay: quest AhtUrhgan.WakingTheColossus accepted
fay: charvar Quest[6][74]Prog 2
fay: keyitem ImperialMissive
fay: mission Bastok TheFourMusketeers current
login
trigger Naja_Salaheem                   # 929 over the Private First Class's 5001
finish option=1
bob: login
bob: mission Toau EternalMercenary current   # a GM
bob: trigger Imperial_Whitegate         # 926 ties 5092: the first container's
bob: finish option=1
bob: trigger Imperial_Whitegate         # rotated: the other
bob: finish option=1
carl: login
carl: trigger Imperial_Whitegate        # 927 ties 5092
carl: finish option=1
dan: login
dan: trigger Imperial_Whitegate         # 928 ties 5092
dan: finish option=1
eve: login
eve: trigger _6r9                       # Prog 1: 10115
eve: finish                             # Prog 2
eve: charvar Quest[6][74]Prog 1         # a GM
eve: trigger _6r9                       # 10115 again
eve: finish
fay: login
fay: missionstatus Bastok 0
fay: trigger Iron_Eater                 # 968 ties 715: the first container's
fay: finish option=1
fay: trigger Iron_Eater                 # rotated: the other
fay: finish option=1
